          "kind": "WRITE",
          "points": 0.25,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"pe-system\"><b>System / Context:</b><br/><p>FER202 PE — SUMMER 2025 Trial Test (Đề 8), 90 minutes. Build a React app (Vite or CRA) <b>StudentManagement</b> on the <b>studentManagement</b> resource. Schema: <code>id</code> (Object ID), <code>name</code> (String), <code>dateofbirth</code> (String), <code>gender</code> (Boolean: true = Male, false = Female), <code>class</code> (String), <code>image</code> (String, URL), <code>feedback</code> (String). The endpoint is stored in <code>.env</code> (Vite: <code>VITE_API_URL</code>). Download the <b>Given</b> zip (paper.pdf, students.json, database.json, Note.txt). In the real exam the resource is created on <i>mockapi.io</i>; to practise offline run <code>npx json-server --watch database.json --port 9999</code> and use <code>VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:9999/studentManagement</code>. Routes: <code>/</code> (Home), <code>/student/:id</code>, <code>/management</code> (Dashboard), <code>/addStudent</code>, <code>/contact</code>.</p></div><p><b>Question 1 (0.25 points)</b> — <b>Task 1.1</b>: Create a new resource called <b>studentManagement</b> in <i>mockapi.io</i> and declare a <b>Schema</b> for it: id (Object ID), name (String), dateofbirth (String), gender (Boolean), class (String), image (String), feedback (String). Store the endpoint in <code>.env</code>.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"pe-system\"><b>Hệ thống / Bối cảnh:</b><br/><p>PE FER202 — SUMMER 2025 thi thử (Đề 8), 90 phút. Dựng app React (Vite hoặc CRA) <b>StudentManagement</b> trên resource <b>studentManagement</b>. Schema: <code>id</code> (Object ID), <code>name</code>, <code>dateofbirth</code>, <code>gender</code> (Boolean: true = Male, false = Female), <code>class</code>, <code>image</code> (URL), <code>feedback</code>. Endpoint để trong <code>.env</code> (Vite: <code>VITE_API_URL</code>). Tải file <b>Given</b> (paper.pdf, students.json, database.json, Note.txt). Thi thật tạo resource trên <i>mockapi.io</i>; luyện không mạng thì chạy <code>npx json-server --watch database.json --port 9999</code> và đặt <code>VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:9999/studentManagement</code>. Route: <code>/</code> (Home), <code>/student/:id</code>, <code>/management</code> (Dashboard), <code>/addStudent</code>, <code>/contact</code>.</p></div><p><b>Câu 1 (0,25 điểm)</b> — <b>Task 1.1</b>: Tạo resource <b>studentManagement</b> trên <i>mockapi.io</i> và khai báo <b>Schema</b>: id (Object ID), name, dateofbirth, gender (Boolean), class, image, feedback (String). Lưu endpoint vào <code>.env</code>.</p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><pre><code>// .env\nVITE_API_URL=http://localhost:9999/studentManagement</code></pre><br/><pre><code>// src/api.js\nimport axios from \"axios\";\n\n// Endpoint of the studentManagement resource, stored in .env\n//   VITE_API_URL=https://&lt;id&gt;.mockapi.io/api/v1/studentManagement   (mockapi.io)\n//   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:9999/studentManagement           (json-server + database.json)\nexport const API = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL;\n\nexport const getStudents = () =&gt; axios.get(API).then((r) =&gt; r.data);\nexport const getStudent = (id) =&gt; axios.get(`${API}/${id}`).then((r) =&gt; r.data);\nexport const addStudent = (s) =&gt; axios.post(API, s).then((r) =&gt; r.data);\nexport const updateStudent = (id, s) =&gt; axios.put(`${API}/${id}`, s).then((r) =&gt; r.data);\nexport const deleteStudent = (id) =&gt; axios.delete(`${API}/${id}`);\n\nexport const genderText = (g) =&gt; (g === true || g === \"true\" ? \"Male\" : \"Female\");</code></pre><p>mockapi.io: <b>New Resource</b> named exactly <code>studentManagement</code>, fields name/dateofbirth/class/image/feedback = String, gender = <b>Boolean</b> (id is generated). The endpoint goes into <code>.env</code> and is read with <code>import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL</code> (CRA: <code>process.env.REACT_APP_API_URL</code>). Offline the same URL shape is served by json-server.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><pre><code>// .env\nVITE_API_URL=http://localhost:9999/studentManagement</code></pre><br/><pre><code>// src/api.js\nimport axios from \"axios\";\n\n// Endpoint of the studentManagement resource, stored in .env\n//   VITE_API_URL=https://&lt;id&gt;.mockapi.io/api/v1/studentManagement   (mockapi.io)\n//   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:9999/studentManagement           (json-server + database.json)\nexport const API = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL;\n\nexport const getStudents = () =&gt; axios.get(API).then((r) =&gt; r.data);\nexport const getStudent = (id) =&gt; axios.get(`${API}/${id}`).then((r) =&gt; r.data);\nexport const addStudent = (s) =&gt; axios.post(API, s).then((r) =&gt; r.data);\nexport const updateStudent = (id, s) =&gt; axios.put(`${API}/${id}`, s).then((r) =&gt; r.data);\nexport const deleteStudent = (id) =&gt; axios.delete(`${API}/${id}`);\n\nexport const genderText = (g) =&gt; (g === true || g === \"true\" ? \"Male\" : \"Female\");</code></pre><p>mockapi.io: <b>New Resource</b> tên đúng <code>studentManagement</code>, các trường name/dateofbirth/class/image/feedback kiểu String, gender kiểu <b>Boolean</b> (id tự sinh). Endpoint để trong <code>.env</code>, đọc bằng <code>import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL</code> (CRA: <code>process.env.REACT_APP_API_URL</code>). Offline thì json-server phục vụ cùng dạng URL.</p></div>",
