          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>Question 4 (2 points)</b> — <b>Task 2, Q4</b>: On the <b>home</b> route, show all the students from the data, sorted by <b>name</b> in ascending order. Each student must include: <b>Id</b>, <b>Name</b>, <b>DateOfBirth</b>, <b>Gender</b> (Male/Female), <b>Class</b>, <b>Image</b>. When the detail button or <b>Id</b> is clicked, the view switches to the <b>detail</b> route.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>Câu 4 (2 điểm)</b> — <b>Task 2, Q4</b>: Ở route <b>home</b>, hiện mọi sinh viên, sắp theo <b>name</b> tăng dần. Mỗi sinh viên có: <b>Id</b>, <b>Name</b>, <b>DateOfBirth</b>, <b>Gender</b> (Male/Female), <b>Class</b>, <b>Image</b>. Bấm nút detail hoặc <b>Id</b> thì chuyển sang route <b>detail</b>.</p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><pre><code>// src/pages/Home.js\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { Link } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { Row, Col, Card, Button } from \"react-bootstrap\";\nimport { getStudents, genderText } from \"../api\";\n\n// Q4 — all students sorted by name (ascending)\nexport default function Home() {\n  const [students, setStudents] = useState([]);\n\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    getStudents().then(setStudents);\n  }, []);\n\n  const sorted = [...students].sort((a, b) =&gt; a.name.localeCompare(b.name));\n\n  return (\n    &lt;&gt;\n      &lt;h2 className=\"mb-3\"&gt;Students&lt;/h2&gt;\n      &lt;Row xs={1} sm={2} md={4} className=\"g-3\"&gt;\n        {sorted.map((s) =&gt; (\n          &lt;Col key={s.id}&gt;\n            &lt;Card className=\"h-100 text-center\"&gt;\n              &lt;Card.Img variant=\"top\" src={s.image} alt={s.name} style={{ height: 160, objectFit: \"cover\" }} /&gt;\n              &lt;Card.Body&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text className=\"mb-1\"&gt;\n                  &lt;b&gt;Id:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;Link to={`/student/${s.id}`}&gt;{s.id}&lt;/Link&gt;\n                &lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Title as=\"h6\"&gt;{s.name}&lt;/Card.Title&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text className=\"mb-0\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;DateOfBirth:&lt;/b&gt; {s.dateofbirth}&lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text className=\"mb-0\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gender:&lt;/b&gt; {genderText(s.gender)}&lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text&gt;&lt;b&gt;Class:&lt;/b&gt; {s.class}&lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;Button as={Link} to={`/student/${s.id}`} size=\"sm\"&gt;Detail&lt;/Button&gt;\n              &lt;/Card.Body&gt;\n            &lt;/Card&gt;\n          &lt;/Col&gt;\n        ))}\n      &lt;/Row&gt;\n    &lt;/&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre><p>Sort a COPY with <code>localeCompare</code>; both the Id link and the Detail button go to <code>/student/:id</code>; gender boolean → Male/Female.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><pre><code>// src/pages/Home.js\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { Link } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { Row, Col, Card, Button } from \"react-bootstrap\";\nimport { getStudents, genderText } from \"../api\";\n\n// Q4 — all students sorted by name (ascending)\nexport default function Home() {\n  const [students, setStudents] = useState([]);\n\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    getStudents().then(setStudents);\n  }, []);\n\n  const sorted = [...students].sort((a, b) =&gt; a.name.localeCompare(b.name));\n\n  return (\n    &lt;&gt;\n      &lt;h2 className=\"mb-3\"&gt;Students&lt;/h2&gt;\n      &lt;Row xs={1} sm={2} md={4} className=\"g-3\"&gt;\n        {sorted.map((s) =&gt; (\n          &lt;Col key={s.id}&gt;\n            &lt;Card className=\"h-100 text-center\"&gt;\n              &lt;Card.Img variant=\"top\" src={s.image} alt={s.name} style={{ height: 160, objectFit: \"cover\" }} /&gt;\n              &lt;Card.Body&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text className=\"mb-1\"&gt;\n                  &lt;b&gt;Id:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;Link to={`/student/${s.id}`}&gt;{s.id}&lt;/Link&gt;\n                &lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Title as=\"h6\"&gt;{s.name}&lt;/Card.Title&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text className=\"mb-0\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;DateOfBirth:&lt;/b&gt; {s.dateofbirth}&lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text className=\"mb-0\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gender:&lt;/b&gt; {genderText(s.gender)}&lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text&gt;&lt;b&gt;Class:&lt;/b&gt; {s.class}&lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;Button as={Link} to={`/student/${s.id}`} size=\"sm\"&gt;Detail&lt;/Button&gt;\n              &lt;/Card.Body&gt;\n            &lt;/Card&gt;\n          &lt;/Col&gt;\n        ))}\n      &lt;/Row&gt;\n    &lt;/&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre><p>Sắp một BẢN SAO bằng <code>localeCompare</code>; cả link Id và nút Detail dẫn tới <code>/student/:id</code>; gender boolean → Male/Female.</p></div>",
